sequenceDiagram
    participant F as founder 频道
    participant P as Discord 插件 0.0.5(fork PR #35;23)
    participant M as mailbox(chat-ingest)
    participant L as Lead
    F->>P: founder 消息
    P->>M: chat-ingest(durable intent,可重试)
    M-->>L: mailbox 批次投递
    L->>P: reply(reply_to)
    P->>F: 回复送达 ✅(零 settle、零 chat-receipt 调用)
    Note over P: ingest 故障 → stderr 日志(只记一次)<br/>物理上没有向频道发内部告警的通路
